<table border="0" cellpadding="5" width="550" cellspacing="5" height="400" >
<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; margin-bottom: 6pt; line-height: 13pt;"></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; margin-bottom: 6pt; line-height: 13pt;">Dear Client Contact, <o:p></o:p></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; margin-bottom: 6pt; line-height: 13pt;"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; margin-bottom: 6pt; line-height: 13pt;">Welcome to Insperity from the Reporting &amp; Compliance Group of
Insperity's Health and Welfare Services department. Our group assists Insperity
clients with compliance in regards to the Play or Pay provisions of the
Affordable Care Act (ACA). &nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; margin-bottom: 6pt; line-height: 13pt;">The attached document <b>ACA (Play or Pay) for Insperity Clients </b>will
help explain these provisions and how Insperity complies with them in regards
to Insperity-sponsored benefit plans. <o:p></o:p></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; margin-bottom: 6pt; line-height: 13pt;"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; line-height: 13pt;"><b><span style="font-size:12.0pt">ACA Information Verification: <span style="color:red">Action
Required <o:p></o:p></span></span></b></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; line-height: 13pt;"><b>&nbsp;</b></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; margin-left: 0.5in; line-height: 13pt;">As part of our efforts to assist you, our Reporting &amp; Compliance
Group would like to confirm certain employer information for your company, and
request additional information as well. &nbsp;Please reply to this email to
provide confirmation, additional information, or make corrections to the
information below to ensure ACA employer and employee calculations are
accurate. <o:p></o:p></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; margin-left: 0.5in; line-height: 13pt;"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; margin-left: 0.5in; line-height: 13pt;">For a brief description of the below terminology please see the
attached document <b>ACA Definitions Quick Reference Guide for Insperity
Clients </b>.</p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; margin-left: 0.5in; line-height: 13pt;"><i style="text-indent: 0.5in; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-size:9.0pt"><br></span></i></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-left: 0.5in; line-height: 13pt;"><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;; font-weight: var(--lwc-fontWeightBold,700);"><font style="" color="#ff0000" size="5">"&lt;Insert ALE table here.&gt;"</font></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; margin-left: 0.5in; line-height: 13pt;"><i style="text-indent: 0.5in; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-size:9.0pt">&nbsp;</span></i></p><p class="MsoPlainText" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;"><b><span style="font-size:12.0pt">Predecessor Hours
Request: <span style="color:red"><o:p></o:p></span></span></b></p><p class="MsoPlainText" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;"><b><span style="font-size:12.0pt;color:red">&nbsp;</span></b></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; margin-left: 0.5in;">Insperity records show that all of
your employees since joining Insperity are full-time. If you confirm this,
Insperity will use its selected default for full-time employees (8 hours per
day, 5 days a week) when calculating your company's ALE status and employee
hours. However, if any of your employees were NOT full-time prior to joining
Insperity, Insperity will be happy to use the hours you provide for those
employees for its calculations. <o:p></o:p></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;">Thank you for your prompt attention to this time sensitive
matter. <o:p></o:p></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;">If you have any questions, please do not hesitate to contact
us at <a href="mailto:ale@insperity.com"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;
font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">ale@insperity.com </span></a><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">. <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">Kind
Regards, <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; margin-bottom: 6pt; line-height: 13pt;">









































</p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;"><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(36, 36, 36); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, system-ui, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Web&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;">&lt;insert signature&gt;</span></p><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;"><div><p></p></div></div>]]></td>
</tr>
